{
"#name"
:
{
"dns"
:
null
,
"en"
:
"DNS utilities"
,
"cn"
:
"DNS 工具"
}
,
"#synopsis"
:
[
{
"x dns"
:
null
}
,
{
"x dns current|c"
:
null
}
,
{
"x dns ls"
:
null
}
,
{
"x dns refresh|r"
:
null
}
,
{
"x dns reload"
:
null
}
,
{
"x dns set [target] <ip> [ip ...]"
:
null
}
,
{
"x dns set --file <ip> [ip ...]"
:
null
}
,
{
"x dns set --dry-run <ip> [ip ...]"
:
null
}
,
{
"x dns reset [target]"
:
null
}
,
{
"x dns backup <name>"
:
null
}
,
{
"x dns restore <name>"
:
null
}
]
,
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"DNS (Domain Name System) configuration management utilities.\nView current DNS settings, list available DNS servers,\nand refresh DNS cache on the system.\n"
,
"cn"
:
"DNS（域名系统）配置管理工具。\n查看当前 DNS 设置、列出可用的 DNS 服务器、\n以及刷新系统上的 DNS 缓存。\n"
}
,
"#subcmd:Command"
:
[
"current|c"
,
"ls"
,
"refresh|r"
,
"set"
,
"reset"
,
"backup"
,
"restore"
]
,
"current|c"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"View the current DNS configuration information"
,
"cn"
:
"查看当前 DNS 配置信息"
}
}
,
"ls"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"List available DNS server addresses"
,
"cn"
:
"列出可用的 DNS 服务器地址"
}
,
"--json"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Display DNS configuration in JSON format"
,
"cn"
:
"以 JSON 格式显示 DNS 配置"
}
}
,
"--yml"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Display DNS configuration in YAML format"
,
"cn"
:
"以 YAML 格式显示 DNS 配置"
}
}
,
"--csv"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Display DNS configuration in CSV format"
,
"cn"
:
"以 CSV 格式显示 DNS 配置"
}
}
,
"--tsv"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Display DNS configuration in TSV format (default when stdout is not a TTY)"
,
"cn"
:
"以 TSV 格式显示 DNS 配置（输出非 TTY 时默认）"
}
}
}
,
"refresh|r"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Flush the DNS response cache"
,
"cn"
:
"刷新 DNS 响应缓存"
}
}
,
"reload"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Reload the DNS configuration (make the service re-read config)"
,
"cn"
:
"重新加载 DNS 配置（让服务重读配置）"
}
}
,
"set"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Set DNS servers (system-wide by default; per-target if a target is given)"
,
"cn"
:
"设置 DNS 服务器（无 target 时系统级；有 target 时针对该 target）"
}
,
"--file"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Write directly to /etc/resolv.conf (Linux only; bypasses NetworkManager)"
,
"cn"
:
"直接写入 /etc/resolv.conf（仅 Linux，绕过 NetworkManager）"
}
}
,
"--dry-run"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Print commands that would run, do not execute"
,
"cn"
:
"打印将运行的命令但不执行"
}
}
,
"--no-ipv4"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Skip IPv4 servers"
,
"cn"
:
"跳过 IPv4 服务器"
}
}
,
"--no-ipv6"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Skip IPv6 servers"
,
"cn"
:
"跳过 IPv6 服务器"
}
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"cn"
:
"无 target 时系统级：macOS 走 `scutil`，Windows 走所有物理网卡，\nLinux 三层 fallback：NetworkManager → systemd-resolved → /etc/resolv.conf。\n有 target 时 per-target：macOS 走 `networksetup`，Linux 走 `nmcli`，\nWindows 走 `Set-DnsClientServerAddress`。\n自动识别 IPv4 / IPv6 地址。需要 root 权限（sudo）。\n"
,
"en"
:
"Without target: system-wide.\n  macOS -> scutil; Windows -> every physical adapter;\n  Linux -> 3-tier fallback: NetworkManager -> systemd-resolved -> /etc/resolv.conf.\nWith target: per-target.\n  macOS -> networksetup; Linux -> nmcli;\n  Windows -> Set-DnsClientServerAddress.\nIPv4 / IPv6 auto-detected. Requires root (sudo).\n"
}
]
}
,
"reset"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Revert DNS to automatic / DHCP defaults (system-wide; per-target if a target is given)"
,
"cn"
:
"还原 DNS 为自动 / DHCP 默认值（无 target 时系统级；有 target 时针对该 target）"
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"cn"
:
"清除手动设置的 DNS，恢复从 DHCP / Router 接收的 DNS。\n无 target 时系统级还原，有 target 时只还原该 target。\n"
,
"en"
:
"Clear manually-set DNS and revert to DHCP / router-provided servers.\nSystem-wide without target; per-target with target.\n"
}
]
}
,
"backup"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Save current DNS state to a named backup"
,
"cn"
:
"将当前 DNS 状态保存到命名备份"
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"cn"
:
"备份文件存放在 `$___X_CMD_ROOT_DATA/dns/backup/<name>.json`。\n配合 `x dns restore` 使用，可在更换 DNS 前保存当前状态。\n"
,
"en"
:
"Backup files are stored at `$___X_CMD_ROOT_DATA/dns/backup/<name>.json`.\nUse with `x dns restore` to save state before changing DNS.\n"
}
]
}
,
"restore"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Restore DNS from a previous backup"
,
"cn"
:
"从之前的备份还原 DNS"
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"cn"
:
"从 `$___X_CMD_ROOT_DATA/dns/backup/<name>.json` 读取并应用。\n"
,
"en"
:
"Reads from `$___X_CMD_ROOT_DATA/dns/backup/<name>.json` and applies it.\n"
}
]
}
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x dns"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Show current DNS configuration"
,
"cn"
:
"示例: 显示当前 DNS 配置"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x dns current"
,
"en"
:
"Example: View detailed current DNS settings"
,
"cn"
:
"示例: 查看详细的当前 DNS 设置"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x dns ls"
,
"en"
:
"Example: List all available DNS servers"
,
"cn"
:
"示例: 列出所有可用的 DNS 服务器"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x dns ls --json"
,
"en"
:
"Example: List DNS servers in JSON format"
,
"cn"
:
"示例: 以 JSON 格式列出 DNS 服务器"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x dns ls | cat"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Pipe the list (auto-falls back to TSV when stdout is not a TTY)"
,
"cn"
:
"示例: 管道输出（输出非 TTY 时自动回退为 TSV）"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x dns refresh"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Refresh DNS cache on the system"
,
"cn"
:
"示例: 刷新系统 DNS 缓存"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x dns reload"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Reload DNS configuration (re-read config without changing it)"
,
"cn"
:
"示例: 重新加载 DNS 配置（不改变配置，仅让服务重读）"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x dns set 8.8.8.8 1.1.1.1"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Set system-wide DNS (default behavior; scutil / all interfaces / Linux 3-tier fallback)"
,
"cn"
:
"示例: 设置系统级 DNS（默认行为；scutil / 所有网卡 / Linux 三层 fallback）"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x dns set Wi-Fi 8.8.8.8 8.8.4.4"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Set DNS for a specific service / connection / interface"
,
"cn"
:
"示例: 给特定的 service / connection / interface 设置 DNS"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x dns set --file 8.8.8.8"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Write directly to /etc/resolv.conf (Linux only; containers, chroots)"
,
"cn"
:
"示例: 直接写入 /etc/resolv.conf（仅 Linux；容器、chroot 场景）"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x dns set --dry-run 8.8.8.8"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Preview the commands without executing them"
,
"cn"
:
"示例: 预览将运行的命令但不执行"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x dns reset"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Revert system-wide DNS to DHCP"
,
"cn"
:
"示例: 还原系统级 DNS 为 DHCP"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x dns reset Wi-Fi"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Revert a specific service / connection / interface to DHCP"
,
"cn"
:
"示例: 还原特定 service / connection / interface 为 DHCP"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x dns backup home-router"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Save current DNS state as 'home-router'"
,
"cn"
:
"示例: 将当前 DNS 状态保存为 home-router"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x dns restore home-router"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Restore DNS from the 'home-router' backup"
,
"cn"
:
"示例: 从 home-router 备份还原 DNS"
}
]
,
"#other"
:
{
"en"
:
{
"Please visit our homepage for more information:"
:
"https://x-cmd.com"
}
,
"cn"
:
{
"请访问我们的主页以获取更多信息："
:
"https://x-cmd.com"
}
}
}

